ve a passive health regeneration.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"在你的光环中放出一股不死能量。\n\t\t所有随从获得 25%% 速度，持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t所有非食尸鬼的随从被治疗 %d%%。\n\t\t如果你掌握陵墓召唤技能，到下一个免费食尸鬼的时间降低 %d。\n\t\t如果你掌握夺命尸爆或腐烂液化技能，这些效果的持续时间延长 %d。\n\t\t所有非不死生物的敌人都会被眩晕 %d 回合。\n\t\t此外，你的所有随从（在学会该法术后制造的）获得额外被动生命回复。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"08328074901148aee75b45835cf169e1856db2728d99921e689e4df136b53244","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9f43cff8aa2d263e0eef54edb87889fd29dc995853fcd9dcfae0972b214923d0","logical_entry_identity":"bff17fd9f77283540c084f9baf88b82da6e34285a1ea40f15322073648f4cab1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Plate of the Blackened Mind","source_tag":"entity name","target":"堕落灵魂之甲"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"db3b912f7ad7609ab33d8dd26f463f1b1e31eb663e9b68a6641ec547a8335661","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9f441031807fd6cd487d055ddfd33196536f6973d6bf86433ea8a3a9537f00ed","logical_entry_identity":"2b376d605b20e0c87ebd0c87106ce7434c3b4fa53d5161c5b6befa3664f18d76","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Ra'kk kor merk ZUR!!!","source_tag":"_t","target":"啊呃……咔咔……呜呃……！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5905f7a0ca904d69672f9cbe13eef4129dda6d9a05ba5b00e7c446726da267fc","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9f4742199feb0fc829c94a4483cdca88d4c853f75acabdf7b9c83bd1b8e4ab92","logical_entry_identity":"c2f421029f454454e4b8b2ba686ef6118846357e02d0a96b52c4e2f822c858ca","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"-Mind Link","source_tag":"_t","target":"-精神通道"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2aa0b37ba03ae35ba0b521b162e5b23abdf0d49ad57f4c378ef98efd0b447c4d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9f47a2dcaa94e5250ce216ca882cd4325dc3567da2d9e68ca3aca88955e18315","logical_entry_identity":"a1668b8863e92ee2e7904db92451f34990e6add04460207e79afc5256fa66a02","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Relaxed Shot","source_tag":"talent name","target":"宁神射击"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ee990c2f9e1798b5d1b58a533d40724d33b827077ba2b