y: Age of Dusk","source_tag":"_t","target":"钢铁王座的盈利历史　黄昏纪"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8ac4cd35cdf6f1501bf3523ffb4e21efbaab6d41137e13d7c4d3fc8f8205cb90","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9f54ac4a1f4c03d20ba712bf5b9654d889bc036756fbdbcc5a1c5c4d9f83a48d","logical_entry_identity":"9935ec0dd0a4751a141ac3f04fc3e09a66f8d668a88958a1dadbd8ff50f71c31","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A gate into the Maze","source_tag":"entity name","target":"进入迷宫的门"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1737af6909a60e89114e9edc1ae3219543d549a9837faf1f64c602a855df2127","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9f55b32bc8865a12f333725df426646df5b3fb155766d028ded3cc33d18280fb","logical_entry_identity":"970fec0d9debfbd9519dfa5170567d8d7fa5dad6c5a8aa361598a60623b19219","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Some people, either through training or magic, can take on the defining aspects of the dragon-kin themselves.\nYou have consumed a magic that allows you to gain such a power. You can now also create new characters with the #LIGHT_GREEN#Wyrmic class#WHITE#.\n\nWyrmics are Wilders, who are at home in the wilds and draw their power from their connection with the dragons.\nClass features:#YELLOW#\n- Take on the aspects of drakes: fire, cold, sand, and more\n- Breath weapons: fire, ice, sand, and more\n- Powerful melee combatant#WHITE#\n\nAll Wilder classes use Equilibrium for their powers. It represents their connection to nature. \nThe higher it gets the more off-balance they are with it. A high equilibrium makes for a chance to fail to use a power and lose a turn.\nWyrmics are also trained in the martial arts and use stamina for some techniques.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"有些人，无论通过训练还是魔法，都能获得龙族的特征。\n你已经吞服了能让你获得这种力量的魔法。现在你可以在创建人物时选择新的职业：#LIGHT_GREEN#龙战士#WHITE#。\n\n龙战士属于野性系，以野外为家，力量来自于与龙族的联系。\n职业特点：#YELLOW#\n- 获得龙兽的形态特征：火焰、寒冷、沙土等\n- 吐息武器：火焰、寒冰、沙土等\n- 强大的近战战斗能力#WHITE#\n\n所有野性系职业使用自然失衡值作为其能量，它与自然之间的联系密切相关。\n失衡值越高，他们与自然越不平衡。失衡值过高可能导致能力使用失败并损失一个回合。\n此外龙战士也受过武术训练，使用体力值施展部分技巧。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"549dbf97e5ce8eedc6480e49522e0298a3c476499a6b363b332fcdea8733919e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9f5a2b9c6938080769dd4a24305764c7475b95c32aa2a06046002ece9db51a50","logical_entry_identity":"aff651ff061d6c665f2287c38c0d6e1edbf95c9500b57faae73aae04ac924896","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Though slavery is illegal there is still a black market for it, and in some areas men are even used for blood sports.","source_tag":"init.lua load_tips","target":"尽管贩奴被严令禁止但地下交易却仍然存在。有些地方奴隶甚至被作为一种血腥运动项目的道具。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"792932013ef681a89168e53ddcf1a1c0fbcd78dc41e08df01813bfd490b52fb8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9f5ab1d756e19e439f89f31a0538eb94ec946adb6fa0240ad48638132e053150","logical_entry_identity":"b703c69ebf7aa508cd55dd3e01e448ee931ec718e10853c1e0472ace43dc08b7","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"I'M IN.","source_tag":"_t","target":"我接受。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9c414de27ec70663c97409a1ac9134b833f053bd49e01133f550cf4aec201f61","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9f5ae9298c8b335d3663121b6c8abd7c74114d62680b3d31b539e2e76fc2cdce","logical_entry_identity":"6563ca2a9acce58b520cae992e2acd07c3b7822e13e89e19f2c5712c1a36b780","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"violet","source_tag":"gem subtype","target":"紫色"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d0907314ea4f87b76019c4f7318e43de46452c91704523d73318a706ad0a4c81","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9f5b87cc3413e305f4f5222bd80833249b578785da870243874a5f67fbce929e","logical_entry_identity":"6e2be38789fee361a2a68ac39c0acd1717971f89b93f120ceaba536ee7234655","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Confused by the gloom","source_tag":"_t","target":"黑暗混乱"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"60b33b4a36509eedb5ac842eadd86681e01d65d4c7a0cb026c247772efd117c8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9f64783e4066a145bb839515822ed26c9f58c3b189ef2a6c05ae79b30d02341f","logical_entry_id